# Gunj AI

This repository contains the starter monorepo for Gunj AI, a personal AI assistant and project agent system.

## Apps

- `apps/web` — Next.js web application
- `apps/mobile` — Expo React Native app

## Services

- `services/api` — FastAPI backend
- `services/agent` — AI orchestration layer
- `services/integrations` — external service connectors

## Packages

- `packages/shared` — reusable TypeScript types and utilities
